WEBVTT

00:00:08.842 --> 00:00:11.220
"Get over here, now!"

00:00:12.888 --> 00:00:16.600
Why would Kozakura say that?

00:00:22.314 --> 00:00:25.526
We've been to the Otherside after that incident,

00:00:25.526 --> 00:00:30.781
but Toriko hasn't mentioned
the name Satsuki Uruma since then.

00:00:30.781 --> 00:00:33.283
Is she avoiding it on purpose?

00:00:34.535 --> 00:00:36.620
Look how long it's gotten.

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:37.871
Huh?

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:40.499
Your hair.

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:49.049
I haven't got it cut in a while.

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:52.094
The last time was before I met you.

00:00:52.094 --> 00:00:55.389
Does it bother you? Should I get it cut?

00:00:55.389 --> 00:00:56.807
No.

00:00:56.807 --> 00:01:02.354
Your hair is so dark and silky.
I bet long hair would look cute, too.

00:01:04.982 --> 00:01:07.943
You really think so?

00:01:07.943 --> 00:01:11.780
Yeah. I know you'd look great.

00:01:29.089 --> 00:01:33.427
<i>School never taught me what friends are</i>

00:01:33.427 --> 00:01:38.807
<i>People are such difficult creatures</i>

00:01:38.807 --> 00:01:43.228
<i>This world where you never</i>
<i>know what's said behind your back</i>

00:01:43.228 --> 00:01:48.775
<i>Looks a little ugly to me</i>

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:53.655
<i>Compassion and ego sway on the scales</i>

00:01:53.655 --> 00:01:58.202
<i>They've swayed ever since I met you</i>

00:01:58.202 --> 00:02:01.121
<i>Your trespassing did a number on me</i>

00:02:01.121 --> 00:02:05.417
<i>It's not like anyone would do</i>

00:02:05.417 --> 00:02:05.501
<i>Is your empathy and complicity just an act?</i>

00:02:05.501 --> 00:02:06.668
"Kisaragi"
"Katasu - Yami"
<i>Is your empathy and complicity just an act?</i>

00:02:06.668 --> 00:02:10.923
<i>Is your empathy and complicity just an act?</i>

00:02:10.923 --> 00:02:15.260
<i>Like a fish out of water</i>

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:17.554
<i>Delicacy and literacy</i>

00:02:17.554 --> 00:02:20.140
<i>Might not be necessary</i>

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:23.310
<i>I just want to be wanted</i>

00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:25.729
<i>Selfish little me</i>

00:02:25.729 --> 00:02:29.900
<i>The scales have tipped</i>

00:02:29.900 --> 00:02:32.152
<i>As friends</i>

00:02:32.152 --> 00:02:38.158
<i>Let's meet in a secret place</i>

00:02:47.459 --> 00:02:48.669
Karateka?

00:02:48.669 --> 00:02:49.711
Akari?

00:02:49.711 --> 00:02:51.338
What are you doing here?

00:02:51.338 --> 00:02:53.799
Forgive the intrusion, Sorawo!

00:02:53.799 --> 00:02:56.510
She said she needed to talk to you guys.

00:02:56.510 --> 00:02:59.221
Sorry, but when I tried to catch you at school,

00:02:59.221 --> 00:03:02.850
you seemed so busy,
so we never had a chance to talk.

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:07.688
The truth is I was avoiding her
because I didn't want to be bothered.

00:03:07.688 --> 00:03:10.899
That's why she's here.

00:03:10.899 --> 00:03:15.904
She even came bearing a gift.
So polite for a younger classmate.

00:03:19.283 --> 00:03:22.536
Please have some if you'd like.
I'll go make some tea.

00:03:22.536 --> 00:03:27.708
Wait a second! How'd you
even know about Kozakura?

00:03:27.708 --> 00:03:30.127
My tutor, Miss Uruma, told me.

00:03:30.127 --> 00:03:33.338
She said she had a friend
who lives near Shakujii Park.

00:03:33.338 --> 00:03:38.719
You guys said you knew Miss Uruma,
so I thought it was worth a shot.

00:03:38.719 --> 00:03:42.973
I'm pretty good at figuring stuff out.
It's probably the karate.

00:03:42.973 --> 00:03:46.518
What does that have to do with it?

00:03:48.395 --> 00:03:52.316
The point is, she came here
because she needs your help.

00:03:52.316 --> 00:03:54.943
I'm begging you, Sorawo!

00:03:56.361 --> 00:03:59.072
Let's help her, Sorawo.

00:04:02.326 --> 00:04:03.785
Well?

00:04:03.785 --> 00:04:06.538
What attacked you this time?

00:04:07.623 --> 00:04:11.502
I wasn't... attacked.

00:04:11.502 --> 00:04:16.715
Sorawo, have you ever
heard the name Kano Sannuki?

00:04:16.715 --> 00:04:18.425
Kano Sannuki?

00:04:18.425 --> 00:04:20.385
It started a month ago.

00:04:20.385 --> 00:04:22.221
A childhood friend called.

00:04:22.221 --> 00:04:25.641
Her name's Natsumi Ichikawa,
or Nattsun for short.

00:04:25.641 --> 00:04:27.434
"Spiral"

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:33.774
Nattsun?

00:04:33.774 --> 00:04:34.608
What's up?

00:04:34.608 --> 00:04:38.362
I-I, um... I just saw a monkey in my yard.

00:04:38.362 --> 00:04:40.906
A monkey? As in a live animal?

00:04:40.906 --> 00:04:43.659
Yeah, and it talked to me.

00:04:43.659 --> 00:04:44.493
Huh?

00:04:44.493 --> 00:04:49.373
It didn't make any sense.
I'll send a picture I took.

00:05:00.092 --> 00:05:02.302
Is that really a monkey?

00:05:02.302 --> 00:05:03.595
I know, right?

00:05:03.595 --> 00:05:07.975
What did this so-called
monkey say to your friend?

00:05:07.975 --> 00:05:09.226
Let me think...

00:05:09.226 --> 00:05:12.813
"Kano Sannuki is coming, so show her these.

00:05:12.813 --> 00:05:15.274
Say you took them yourself,
and she'll give you some, too.

00:05:15.274 --> 00:05:18.402
Bury them in your yard."

00:05:18.402 --> 00:05:21.613
Sorawo, how'd you know that?

00:05:21.613 --> 00:05:26.535
Easy. The Kano Sannuki urban legend
is pretty famous on the internet.

00:05:26.535 --> 00:05:28.245
Wow!

00:05:28.245 --> 00:05:29.621
I mean, really! Wow!

00:05:29.621 --> 00:05:32.875
I knew I made the right call
coming to you with this!

00:05:32.875 --> 00:05:36.837
Did the monkey leave anything behind?

00:05:36.837 --> 00:05:39.673
In the urban legend, it was human teeth.

00:05:39.673 --> 00:05:42.718
Oh, yeah. She found a few teeth on the ground.

00:05:42.718 --> 00:05:44.553
She said they probably were human.

00:05:44.553 --> 00:05:46.305
So that's the same, too.

00:05:46.305 --> 00:05:49.016
Then you're supposed to
show the teeth to Kano Sannuki

00:05:49.016 --> 00:05:51.101
after saying you took them yourself?

00:05:51.101 --> 00:05:54.980
That's how the story goes.

00:05:54.980 --> 00:05:58.901
"Several days later, an old lady
named Kano Sannuki showed up.

00:05:58.901 --> 00:06:01.737
When I gave her the teeth like the monkey said,

00:06:01.737 --> 00:06:03.947
she gave me a few more.

00:06:03.947 --> 00:06:07.618
After I buried them in my yard,

00:06:07.618 --> 00:06:09.411
the strange events ceased.

00:06:09.411 --> 00:06:12.789
The monkey and the
old lady never appeared again."

00:06:12.789 --> 00:06:13.916
That's it?

00:06:13.916 --> 00:06:15.209
That's it.

00:06:15.209 --> 00:06:19.004
Huh, that's a pretty
plain-vanilla ending this time.

00:06:19.004 --> 00:06:21.590
So did Kano Sannuki ever show?

00:06:21.590 --> 00:06:23.675
About that...

00:06:26.720 --> 00:06:29.890
Nattsun said she threw the teeth out.

00:06:29.890 --> 00:06:30.849
She threw them out?!

00:06:30.849 --> 00:06:32.351
"Private Automobile Inspection
Station Ichikawa Automotive Repair"
She threw them out?!

00:06:32.351 --> 00:06:34.186
"Private Automobile Inspection
Station Ichikawa Automotive Repair"
Anyone there?

00:06:34.186 --> 00:06:35.646
"Private Automobile Inspection
Station Ichikawa Automotive Repair"
Nattsun?

00:06:35.646 --> 00:06:37.314
You there?

00:06:43.237 --> 00:06:45.364
What's up? The name's Ichikawa.

00:06:45.364 --> 00:06:48.784
Thanks for coming by, Kamikoshi.

00:06:48.784 --> 00:06:50.953
No, no!

00:06:50.953 --> 00:06:55.374
That's Toriko Nishina. This is Kamikoshi.

00:06:55.374 --> 00:06:58.168
Oh, my bad.

00:06:58.168 --> 00:07:02.214
So Kamikoshi is...?

00:07:04.675 --> 00:07:06.260
What's that?

00:07:06.260 --> 00:07:08.887
Huh? Oh, this?

00:07:08.887 --> 00:07:12.307
It was all tangled up around the drive shaft.

00:07:12.307 --> 00:07:18.397
I was told it wasn't in an accident,
but this kinda stuff happens a lot lately.

00:07:25.487 --> 00:07:30.993
It was like I heard it in
my head, not with my ears.

00:07:30.993 --> 00:07:33.537
Then the monkey suddenly ran off.

00:07:33.537 --> 00:07:36.290
That's when I noticed
a bunch of teeth at my feet.

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:39.209
You threw them away?

00:07:39.209 --> 00:07:41.420
They grossed me out.

00:07:41.420 --> 00:07:47.176
I probably shouldn't have done that.
It's been nothing but trouble since.

00:07:47.176 --> 00:07:49.928
Three days after the monkey,

00:07:49.928 --> 00:07:53.724
some old lady...

00:07:53.724 --> 00:07:55.809
...hung herself.

00:07:55.809 --> 00:07:59.396
Why would a stranger do that in our yard?

00:07:59.396 --> 00:08:04.318
The police asked all sorts of questions,
but they never got to the bottom of it.

00:08:04.318 --> 00:08:06.820
That's when things really got weird.

00:08:06.820 --> 00:08:10.699
My dad was working on a car when
the jack released, breaking his ribs.

00:08:10.699 --> 00:08:13.285
And my mom was struck by a hit-and-run driver.

00:08:13.285 --> 00:08:14.828
Is she all right?

00:08:14.828 --> 00:08:18.207
She's alive but still in the hospital.

00:08:18.207 --> 00:08:22.461
Now all the cars coming in for repairs
look like they've been in accidents.

00:08:22.461 --> 00:08:24.505
There's been a ton of reports
of suspicious people in the area.

00:08:24.505 --> 00:08:26.924
One old fart was grinning
as he came at me with a knife,

00:08:26.924 --> 00:08:28.717
so I beat him with a wrench.

00:08:28.717 --> 00:08:30.177
And in the middle of the night,

00:08:30.177 --> 00:08:33.055
I got a creepy call of some woman laughing.

00:08:36.058 --> 00:08:39.520
You've been through a lot, Nattsun.

00:08:44.483 --> 00:08:46.777
Sorawo.

00:08:46.777 --> 00:08:50.322
Relax. It'll be a cinch.
We'll just do what we always do.

00:08:50.322 --> 00:08:51.323
But...

00:08:51.323 --> 00:08:53.951
You'll look with your right eye, and I'll--

00:08:53.951 --> 00:08:56.203
No!

00:08:56.203 --> 00:09:01.124
She said the cops were already here.
I don't want to draw any more attention.

00:09:01.124 --> 00:09:02.543
All right.

00:09:02.543 --> 00:09:05.838
Let's start by looking for
the teeth you threw out.

00:09:11.260 --> 00:09:13.303
Anything?

00:09:13.303 --> 00:09:16.473
Maybe they were already taken.

00:09:16.473 --> 00:09:17.808
What do you mean?

00:09:17.808 --> 00:09:21.270
Maybe that old lady who hung
herself over there was Mrs. Sannuki.

00:09:21.270 --> 00:09:23.689
But she was just some old bag.

00:09:23.689 --> 00:09:28.277
Kano Sannuki's supposed to
be some kinda monster, right?

00:09:28.277 --> 00:09:29.862
Find something?

00:09:29.862 --> 00:09:31.530
Maybe.

00:09:41.540 --> 00:09:42.916
What's that?

00:09:42.916 --> 00:09:45.002
Looks like a cremation urn.

00:09:45.002 --> 00:09:46.211
Ring any bells?

00:09:46.211 --> 00:09:48.505
Nope.

00:10:16.158 --> 00:10:19.036
These are all human teeth?

00:10:19.036 --> 00:10:21.622
Which are the teeth the monkey left?

00:10:21.622 --> 00:10:26.668
There's no way to tell 'em apart.
But there definitely wasn't this many.

00:10:26.668 --> 00:10:28.795
Hey, Sorawo.

00:10:29.796 --> 00:10:33.425
It looks like something's
buried over there, too.

00:10:39.515 --> 00:10:41.058
B-Bones?

00:10:41.058 --> 00:10:44.561
Based on their size, I'm guessing a dog.

00:10:44.561 --> 00:10:48.982
Why's the skull missing?
The rest of the skeleton's here.

00:10:48.982 --> 00:10:52.736
There's something over here, too!

00:10:52.736 --> 00:10:56.156
That's... That's our Shinto altar!

00:10:56.156 --> 00:11:00.661
It's the one from our shop,
but I hadn't seen it for a while.

00:11:00.661 --> 00:11:03.247
Somebody took it down and buried it?

00:11:03.247 --> 00:11:05.624
Who'd do that?

00:11:05.624 --> 00:11:09.795
This looks like some sort of curse.

00:11:16.677 --> 00:11:20.305
Let's see if we can find anything else.

00:11:30.899 --> 00:11:35.028
Hey, I was wondering if Satsuki gave
you something like she did to Akari.

00:11:35.028 --> 00:11:36.572
Satsuki?

00:11:36.572 --> 00:11:38.615
Who's that?

00:11:38.615 --> 00:11:42.578
Satsuki Uruma. She was Akari's tutor.

00:11:42.578 --> 00:11:46.081
She's tall and has long black hair.

00:11:46.081 --> 00:11:51.336
I saw her once, but
I can't say I really know her.

00:11:51.336 --> 00:11:52.588
I see.

00:11:52.588 --> 00:11:54.047
Why'd you ask?

00:11:54.047 --> 00:11:58.427
Never mind. I'll go look over here.

00:12:03.140 --> 00:12:05.601
I don't really know her, but...

00:12:05.601 --> 00:12:06.685
Huh?

00:12:06.685 --> 00:12:08.854
That tutor, Satsuki...

00:12:08.854 --> 00:12:12.399
Something about her rubbed me the wrong way.

00:12:12.399 --> 00:12:16.195
Akari often talked about her
around the time of the entrance exams.

00:12:16.195 --> 00:12:21.533
She said she was a great tutor,
super supportive, and knew a ton of stuff.

00:12:21.533 --> 00:12:23.076
But...

00:12:28.916 --> 00:12:30.918
Akari?

00:12:52.314 --> 00:12:56.652
She was, like, kinda creepy,

00:12:56.652 --> 00:13:00.322
especially the way she got so close to Akari.

00:13:00.322 --> 00:13:04.576
It was like Akari was gonna
be taken somewhere far away.

00:13:05.577 --> 00:13:08.288
It was scary.

00:13:08.288 --> 00:13:13.627
She's so cute. That's why
people are always hitting on her.

00:13:13.627 --> 00:13:16.088
I used to send 'em packing when we were kids,

00:13:16.088 --> 00:13:19.508
but she got way stronger
since she learned karate.

00:13:19.508 --> 00:13:23.887
I feel like she really doesn't need me anymore.

00:13:23.887 --> 00:13:28.308
Truth be told, I was on high alert
about you, too, Kamikoshi.

00:13:28.308 --> 00:13:29.309
What?

00:13:29.309 --> 00:13:32.145
Akari said you were amazing

00:13:32.145 --> 00:13:34.565
and that she really respected you.

00:13:34.565 --> 00:13:37.818
When I saw Toriko, I really freaked out.

00:13:37.818 --> 00:13:42.239
I thought, there's no way I'm gonna
compete with a babe like that.

00:13:46.577 --> 00:13:51.874
Man, I'm so glad you turned out to be Kamikoshi.

00:13:51.874 --> 00:13:54.001
Sorawo, behind you!

00:14:03.510 --> 00:14:07.431
I am Kano Sannuki.

00:14:09.600 --> 00:14:12.102
What the hell do you want?

00:14:12.102 --> 00:14:14.479
I did not receive them.

00:14:14.479 --> 00:14:15.564
Huh?

00:14:15.564 --> 00:14:20.736
I did not receive the teeth,
so I cannot give you any.

00:14:20.736 --> 00:14:22.237
What do you mean?

00:14:22.237 --> 00:14:26.950
Now I have no choice but to take them myself.

00:14:28.869 --> 00:14:31.371
Nattsun!

00:14:31.371 --> 00:14:32.873
That's one.

00:14:32.873 --> 00:14:35.626
You old hag! What did you just do to her?

00:14:35.626 --> 00:14:39.087
I am Kano Sannuki.

00:14:45.344 --> 00:14:47.179
Wait!

00:14:51.683 --> 00:14:55.562
May I have one, Karateka?

00:14:55.562 --> 00:14:58.440
Why'd she just use my nickname for Akari?

00:14:58.440 --> 00:15:02.402
Shut your mouth! I'm not giving you a thing.

00:15:09.201 --> 00:15:11.578
Akari, don't!

00:15:17.960 --> 00:15:19.378
That's two.

00:15:19.378 --> 00:15:21.338
Sorawo, it's time.

00:15:21.338 --> 00:15:24.466
Don't! You'll lose a tooth, too.

00:15:24.466 --> 00:15:25.300
But...

00:15:25.300 --> 00:15:27.511
I said don't! Stay!

00:15:27.511 --> 00:15:29.555
St-Stay?

00:15:30.848 --> 00:15:33.475
Akari! She's not human!

00:15:33.475 --> 00:15:35.102
Sh-She's not?

00:15:35.102 --> 00:15:37.729
She's just like those ninja cats.
Feel free to smack her silly!

00:15:37.729 --> 00:15:40.566
Hurry before you lose a tooth!

00:15:42.651 --> 00:15:47.072
Okay, Akari, listen to me. I'll be watching you.

00:15:47.072 --> 00:15:48.115
What?

00:15:48.115 --> 00:15:49.783
I'll be watching.

00:15:49.783 --> 00:15:52.619
Don't you worry. You're strong, Akari.

00:15:52.619 --> 00:15:56.915
Your karate will work on any monster you face.

00:16:04.214 --> 00:16:06.300
Akari?

00:16:09.928 --> 00:16:14.474
Yeah, I thought so.
I really am badass, aren't I?

00:16:14.474 --> 00:16:15.767
Akari?

00:16:15.767 --> 00:16:21.023
Stupid old bitch. You're gonna
pay for hurting Nattsun.

00:16:21.023 --> 00:16:23.984
This is what happens when
you mess with those I love.

00:16:23.984 --> 00:16:27.362
Say your prayers, you monster!

00:16:39.791 --> 00:16:42.127
A-Akari.

00:16:42.127 --> 00:16:45.214
Whoa, she's out for blood.

00:16:51.762 --> 00:16:54.264
Um, Sorawo?

00:16:54.264 --> 00:16:55.974
Right.

00:16:55.974 --> 00:16:58.227
That's enough!

00:16:58.227 --> 00:17:00.437
Huh?

00:17:07.402 --> 00:17:11.573
Kano Sannuki's... gone.

00:17:15.911 --> 00:17:20.082
Sorawo! I did it! I defeated the monster!

00:17:20.082 --> 00:17:21.875
It's all thanks to you!

00:17:21.875 --> 00:17:24.211
C-Cool.

00:17:24.211 --> 00:17:26.755
A-Akari!

00:17:26.755 --> 00:17:28.966
Nattsun!

00:17:28.966 --> 00:17:32.427
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry! This was all my fault.

00:17:32.427 --> 00:17:36.598
Don't worry about it.
I'm just glad you're all right!

00:17:36.598 --> 00:17:39.810
Nattsun? Are you crying?

00:17:39.810 --> 00:17:42.229
I'm not crying!

00:17:42.229 --> 00:17:46.483
Don't worry. Everything will be all right, okay?

00:17:47.901 --> 00:17:49.611
Okay.

00:17:50.821 --> 00:17:52.030
Nattsun.

00:17:52.030 --> 00:17:53.282
Akari.

00:17:53.282 --> 00:17:54.867
Nattsun.

00:17:54.867 --> 00:17:55.367
--Akari.

00:17:55.367 --> 00:17:56.827
--Hey, Sorawo.
--Akari.

00:17:56.827 --> 00:17:57.828
Hm?

00:17:57.828 --> 00:18:01.039
You did something to Akari
with your right eye, didn't you?

00:18:01.039 --> 00:18:04.835
AIl I did was look at her.

00:18:06.712 --> 00:18:11.258
All right. I won't do it again.

00:18:11.258 --> 00:18:14.052
Hey, wasn't I totally badass?

00:18:14.052 --> 00:18:17.514
Yeah. You were, like, super cool.

00:18:17.514 --> 00:18:18.390
Nattsun.

00:18:18.390 --> 00:18:19.892
Akari.

00:18:23.395 --> 00:18:25.856
Umm...

00:18:27.691 --> 00:18:30.777
Maybe I'll try growing my hair out.

00:18:30.777 --> 00:18:36.158
Oh, but my hair's not like yours.
Mine's all black and heavy.

00:18:36.158 --> 00:18:38.952
You think it'd be too much?

00:18:38.952 --> 00:18:40.871
I think it'd be great.

00:18:45.918 --> 00:18:48.420
I really do.

00:18:48.420 --> 00:18:50.547
I bet it'd be cute.

00:18:56.428 --> 00:18:59.097
All's well that ends well!
It's all thanks to you!

00:18:59.097 --> 00:19:01.975
The urn, bones, and Shinto altar

00:19:01.975 --> 00:19:06.188
were burned at the shrine,
and we put up a new altar.

00:19:06.188 --> 00:19:09.650
And Nattsun's parents will
be leaving the hospital soon.

00:19:09.650 --> 00:19:11.360
That's great news.

00:19:11.360 --> 00:19:17.074
It is. And they were able
to put our teeth back in!

00:19:17.074 --> 00:19:19.993
You really are amazing, Sorawo!

00:19:19.993 --> 00:19:20.619
--Huh?

00:19:20.619 --> 00:19:21.203
--You said, "I'll be watching you,"
--Huh?

00:19:21.203 --> 00:19:23.205
--You said, "I'll be watching you,"

00:19:23.205 --> 00:19:25.958
and I suddenly wasn't scared anymore.

00:19:25.958 --> 00:19:30.587
I never knew it could feel so good
to beat the hell out of a monster!

00:19:30.587 --> 00:19:33.799
Oh, y-you don't say.

00:19:33.799 --> 00:19:35.551
I respect you even more now!

00:19:35.551 --> 00:19:40.597
You knew about Kano Sannuki,
and you're an urban legend pro.

00:19:40.597 --> 00:19:44.476
Just so you know, I have
almost no interest in urban legends.

00:19:44.476 --> 00:19:45.060
--Huh?

00:19:45.060 --> 00:19:47.187
--Really?
--Huh?

00:19:47.187 --> 00:19:50.065
Urban legends are just rumors.

00:19:50.065 --> 00:19:52.568
I'm interested in real-life horror stories.

00:19:52.568 --> 00:19:55.362
Really? Why?

00:19:55.362 --> 00:20:00.367
They are first-person accounts of
direct contact with the paranormal.

00:20:00.367 --> 00:20:03.287
Unlike urban legends and their sketchy origins,

00:20:03.287 --> 00:20:07.749
there's a report that clearly states who
experienced what and who reported it.

00:20:07.749 --> 00:20:09.751
That's how I define it.

00:20:09.751 --> 00:20:11.211
A report?

00:20:11.211 --> 00:20:13.130
For horror stories?

00:20:13.130 --> 00:20:14.840
Yeah.

00:20:18.510 --> 00:20:24.558
Scary stories, strange tales,
unexplainable events...

00:20:24.558 --> 00:20:30.272
For me, real-life horror stories are clues
that lead somewhere beyond our world.

00:20:30.272 --> 00:20:35.736
They're tales about those who
saw another world and lived to tell.

00:20:35.736 --> 00:20:39.573
They are somehow compelling and quite serious.

00:20:39.573 --> 00:20:43.243
After reading that kind of stuff like crazy,

00:20:43.243 --> 00:20:45.662
I met Toriko on the Otherside.

00:20:45.662 --> 00:20:49.124
Sorawo, you're growing your hair longer?

00:20:49.124 --> 00:20:51.460
Toriko just told me.

00:20:51.460 --> 00:20:55.881
Oh, yeah. I thought I'd try growing it out.

00:20:55.881 --> 00:20:59.801
I love long, shiny black hair.

00:20:59.801 --> 00:21:02.471
Come to think of it, Sorawo...

00:21:02.471 --> 00:21:04.473
Wh-What?

00:21:04.473 --> 00:21:07.017
You kind of look like Miss Uruma.

00:21:07.017 --> 00:21:08.393
Huh?

00:21:08.393 --> 00:21:09.561
What?

00:21:09.561 --> 00:21:13.273
You've got a totally different body and vibe.

00:21:13.273 --> 00:21:18.695
But the glasses and long black hair
really do make you look like her.

00:21:18.695 --> 00:21:22.366
R-Really?

00:21:33.210 --> 00:21:36.755
Go for it. I bet it'd be cute.

00:21:41.802 --> 00:21:46.139
I look like... Satsuki Uruma?

00:21:58.068 --> 00:22:02.030
"Mrs. Sannuki and Karateka"

00:22:11.623 --> 00:22:15.878
<i>My hair was tossed by the cold wind</i>

00:22:15.878 --> 00:22:20.007
<i>Did you notice me shut the window?</i>

00:22:20.007 --> 00:22:24.303
<i>I lose my nerve when we get so close</i>

00:22:24.303 --> 00:22:28.182
<i>I don't need something that won't last</i>

00:22:28.182 --> 00:22:30.309
<i>Flashbacks hurt</i>

00:22:30.309 --> 00:22:31.935
<i>Ever-lingering shadows</i>

00:22:31.935 --> 00:22:36.106
<i>I know I'm too bound by the past, aren't I?</i>

00:22:36.106 --> 00:22:38.525
<i>Hey, this feeling we felt</i>

00:22:38.525 --> 00:22:44.114
<i>There's no doubt about it,</i>
<i>it's got to be special</i>

00:22:44.114 --> 00:22:47.951
<i>You and me, crisscrossing emotions</i>

00:22:47.951 --> 00:22:52.164
<i>I don't want to look back with regret</i>

00:22:52.164 --> 00:22:57.002
<i>I tell myself to believe</i>

00:22:57.002 --> 00:23:00.964
<i>And I tell my heart,</i>
<i>trust me, trust me, so sparkly</i>

00:23:00.964 --> 00:23:04.760
<i>It's the rhythm of a racing pulse</i>

00:23:04.760 --> 00:23:08.972
<i>As I gazed at your outstretched hand</i>

00:23:08.972 --> 00:23:15.103
<i>I decided I'd put my trust in you</i>

00:23:15.103 --> 00:23:23.529
<i>I will change myself, change myself</i>
<i>I will change myself, change myself</i>

00:23:23.529 --> 00:23:30.911
<i>I will change myself, change myself</i>
<i>I will</i>

00:23:32.579 --> 00:23:35.249
Akari and Nattsun sure seem to like each other.

00:23:35.249 --> 00:23:39.044
Akari... Nattsun! Akari... Nattsun!

00:23:39.044 --> 00:23:40.128
Sorawo!

00:23:40.128 --> 00:23:41.296
Hm? Another beer?

00:23:41.296 --> 00:23:42.339
Sorawo!

00:23:42.339 --> 00:23:43.173
More mackerel?

00:23:43.173 --> 00:23:44.550
You're no fun!

00:23:44.550 --> 00:23:47.094
What?
